# Real-world CVE benchmark (12 cases: 6 SQLi, 6 authz) on the final code. Last end-to-end run was October code (benchmark/runs/archive/real_world). Reviewer on GPU job 2 (Ollama 11436); evaluate.py has no judge flag, so the Kev judge is job 1 (8008), the same model. Queued after stream H so it does not share job 2 with the ablation.
